# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: VariableQuantity and ItemUnderConsideration are
# disjoint. 351-41-01 defines a variable quantity as a physical quantity
# whose value changes, 351-56-01 an item under consideration as an object
# defined by function and scope. A quantity is not a thing.
@prefix iec60050: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#> .
@prefix inst:     <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050/instances#> .
@prefix ex:       <https://w3id.org/aias/example/iec60050/neg#> .
@prefix owl:      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/iec60050/neg04> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050/instances/1.0.0> .
ex:Thing2 a iec60050:VariableQuantity , iec60050:ItemUnderConsideration .
